  "prompt": "For the users who signed up in September 2025, how many were active in each of their first four months? signup_ts and event_ts are UTC instants, so read months in UTC. A user is active in a month with at least one activation event of any kind. The month offset counts calendar months from September 2025: 0 for September itself, up to 3 for December. The as-of date is 5 January 2026, so every month up to December 2025 has ended. A month with no active user shows 0. Return two columns, in this order: month_offset and active_users. Return one row for each month offset from 0 to 3. Any row order is fine.",
